    {
      "source": "As of Spring 4.3, this overrides all factory methods in <code>HandlerInstantiator</code>,\nincluding non-abstract ones and recently introduced ones from Jackson 2.4 and 2.5:\nfor <code>ValueInstantiator</code>, <code>ObjectIdGenerator</code>, <code>ObjectIdResolver</code>,\n<code>PropertyNamingStrategy</code>, <code>Converter</code>, <code>VirtualBeanPropertyWriter</code>.",
      "translation": "自 Spring 4.3 起，此方法覆盖了 `<code>HandlerInstantiator</code>` 中的所有工厂方法，包括非抽象方法和 Jackson 2.4 及 2.5 中最近引入的方法：针对 `<code>ValueInstantiator</code>`、`<code>ObjectIdGenerator</code>`、`<code>ObjectIdResolver</code>`、`<code>PropertyNamingStrategy</code>`、`<code>Converter</code>` 和 `<code>VirtualBeanPropertyWriter</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
